WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,751
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,213 --> 00:00:03,673
A muddy blob is splashing the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:04,135 --> 00:00:06,753
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:07,214 --> 00:00:08,769
This is Episode 46.

5
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:11,639
There is mud on the lemons and mud on the cups.

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:12,917
Maya needs help.

7
00:00:14,117 --> 00:00:17,153
Here comes the sieve gate, with a little wall around the stand.

8
00:00:17,614 --> 00:00:20,587
The gate has one job: it checks everyone who knocks.

9
00:00:21,049 --> 00:00:22,912
Three little friends float up to the gate.

10
00:00:23,374 --> 00:00:25,335
The gate looks, and swings open.

11
00:00:25,797 --> 00:00:26,931
Come in, friends!

12
00:00:27,393 --> 00:00:29,133
Now the blob charges at the gate.

13
00:00:29,595 --> 00:00:31,369
The gate looks, and shuts tight.

14
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:32,274
Bounce!

15
00:00:32,736 --> 00:00:33,145
Splat!

16
00:00:33,607 --> 00:00:34,435
Nothing gets in.

17
00:00:35,635 --> 00:00:37,670
The blob puts on a hat and tries again.

18
00:00:38,132 --> 00:00:38,626
Sneaky!

19
00:00:39,087 --> 00:00:40,183
The gate is not fooled.

20
00:00:40,645 --> 00:00:41,270
Still shut.

21
00:00:41,732 --> 00:00:42,448
Friends get in.

22
00:00:42,909 --> 00:00:45,026
Mud stays out, every single time.

23
00:00:45,488 --> 00:00:46,509
That is the sieve gate.

24
00:00:46,970 --> 00:00:49,038
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

25
00:00:49,499 --> 00:00:53,701
Now you know W-A-F, the Web Application Firewall!

26
00:00:54,163 --> 00:00:56,075
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

27
00:00:56,537 --> 00:00:57,436
Link in the bio.

28
00:00:57,898 --> 00:00:58,850
See you next time!

